###
### D. 数据一致性验证 (MySQL 客户端手动执行)
### 将 <ORDER_CODE> 替换为 A7 的 orderCode_A7 值
###

### D1: 验证 order_detail_technician 表
### SELECT detail_id, user_id, user_name
### FROM order_detail_technician
### WHERE detail_id IN (
###     SELECT id FROM order_detail WHERE order_code='<ORDER_CODE>' AND is_delete=0
### ) AND is_delete=0;
### 预期: 5条记录 (2技师 + 3技师)

### D2: 验证 kpi_detail 表 detail_id 非空
### SELECT id, user_name, detail_id, detail_code, performance, commission
### FROM kpi_detail WHERE order_code='<ORDER_CODE>' AND is_delete=0;
### 预期: detail_id 和 detail_code 均非空

### D3: 验证 KPI 业绩平分
### SELECT detail_id, COUNT(*) as cnt, performance,
###        COUNT(*) * performance as total
### FROM kpi_detail WHERE order_code='<ORDER_CODE>' AND is_delete=0
### GROUP BY detail_id, performance;
### 预期: 明细1 performance=50.00 total=100.00 | 明细2 performance=33.33 total=99.99
